WEBVTT

00:01.100 --> 00:02.190
Hmm...

00:02.980 --> 00:04.809
Hello there! I'm Iura.

00:04.810 --> 00:06.729
I prefer miso ramen over salty ramen.

00:06.730 --> 00:09.979
Here's a question for all of you:
What's your favorite movie genre?

00:09.980 --> 00:13.239
Near-future Sci-Fi... I guess.

00:13.240 --> 00:14.909
Romance!

00:14.910 --> 00:16.369
The classics, I suppose.

00:16.370 --> 00:18.489
Anything you can laugh to!

00:18.490 --> 00:21.539
Something with cute animals!

00:21.540 --> 00:24.329
Eh, Hori-san, weren't
you into horror flicks?

00:24.330 --> 00:27.340
You know, ones with
lots of blood gushing out.

00:28.250 --> 00:29.549
Hori-san.

00:29.550 --> 00:31.880
Hori-san!

00:32.840 --> 00:37.350
Hori-san and Miyamura-kun
is about to start!

00:37.480 --> 00:40.850
- .........
- LIVE-EVIL FANSUBS Presents

00:50.480 --> 00:52.239
It's hot...

00:52.240 --> 00:55.199
I need to get home
and get dinner ready.

00:55.200 --> 00:57.570
Hey, Hori-san!

00:58.200 --> 00:59.369
Shopping?

00:59.370 --> 01:00.030
Eh?

01:00.031 --> 01:01.660
Where are you going?
Can I tag along?

01:02.450 --> 01:03.999
Really hot, ain't it?

01:04.000 --> 01:07.629
You could almost melt out here!
Figure of speech, of course!

01:07.630 --> 01:08.500
Who is he?!

01:08.501 --> 01:09.539
Is that so?

01:09.540 --> 01:12.009
You'd never guess who I saw.

01:12.010 --> 01:12.630
Who was it?

01:12.630 --> 01:13.340
My uncle.

01:13.340 --> 01:14.340
Your uncle?

01:15.840 --> 01:17.260
Isn't that Hori?

01:20.890 --> 01:22.600
Is he hitting on her?

01:24.850 --> 01:26.810
No, I'm on my way home...

01:28.810 --> 01:31.750
Ah, if it isn't Miyamura!
You came at a good tim-

01:32.610 --> 01:35.449
What the hell are you doing, you bastard?!

01:35.450 --> 01:39.700
Well, I ran into Hori-san
and I thought I'd say-

01:41.700 --> 01:44.159
Go home! Stop wandering about year-round!

01:44.160 --> 01:46.370
Go back to online shopping!

01:48.290 --> 01:50.839
Hey, are you OK?

01:50.840 --> 01:52.919
Miyamura, do you know him?

01:52.920 --> 01:54.419
Eh? Nope.

01:54.420 --> 01:59.679
Hold on a sec, we've been best
friends for ages! Introduce me to them!

01:59.680 --> 02:02.389
Shindo-High school
second-year-ex-classmate. That's it.

02:02.390 --> 02:05.309
You're saying it like a
bunch of search terms...

02:05.310 --> 02:08.979
Nice to meet you! I'm
Miyamura's best friend, Shindo!

02:08.980 --> 02:11.269
I know everything there
is to know about this guy.

02:11.270 --> 02:12.270
Huh?

02:12.271 --> 02:15.399
His height in his third year
of junior high was 158 cm,

02:15.400 --> 02:18.949
with a weight of 44 kg, and
perfect eyesight in both eyes.

02:18.950 --> 02:21.119
The girl he liked was next clas-

02:21.120 --> 02:23.029
Why do you know that?! Gross!

02:23.030 --> 02:24.030
Die!

02:30.880 --> 02:33.669
Sorry about him. He's just a moron.

02:33.670 --> 02:35.509
No, I'm sure he isn't a <i>moron</i>.

02:35.510 --> 02:37.169
Isn't he in some top-flight school?

02:37.170 --> 02:40.719
Sure he is. Doesn't make him
any less of a moron, though.

02:40.720 --> 02:41.930
Harsh much?

02:43.430 --> 02:45.060
But I'm surprised...

02:46.390 --> 02:49.309
that you talk about
friends from junior high.

02:49.310 --> 02:51.019
I guess so...

02:51.020 --> 02:53.059
Why don't you try that on Tooru?

02:53.060 --> 02:54.730
Something like, "Tooru, you bastard!"

02:55.150 --> 02:56.359
That's a bit...

02:56.360 --> 02:58.110
Wanna do it?

03:17.090 --> 03:18.970
People's complete and utter indifference...

03:20.170 --> 03:21.170
I got used to it.

03:22.550 --> 03:24.100
People clearly ignoring me...

03:25.720 --> 03:26.720
I got used to them.

03:27.930 --> 03:29.930
Those eyes that said,
"Oh, <i>you're</i> still here?"

03:31.600 --> 03:32.600
I got used to them.

03:34.110 --> 03:35.979
They said we're moving
to the Science classroom!

03:35.980 --> 03:37.479
What?

03:37.480 --> 03:39.150
Why do they do this?

03:41.740 --> 03:42.740
Shindo!

03:42.910 --> 03:44.490
Let me copy your lab report!

03:44.780 --> 03:47.700
Huh? You're on your own.

03:53.000 --> 03:54.330
Let's get going.

03:59.670 --> 04:01.010
That was close!

04:01.510 --> 04:03.800
Huh? You aren't going to class?

04:04.890 --> 04:07.969
Almost forgot my notes... there we are.

04:07.970 --> 04:09.310
Class is starting soon.

04:12.770 --> 04:14.810
Oh, come on!

04:16.980 --> 04:19.609
Let's see... Yamamura?

04:19.610 --> 04:20.440
That's wrong.

04:20.440 --> 04:21.150
What?

04:21.151 --> 04:22.199
That's wrong!

04:22.200 --> 04:24.699
Oh, my bad. Yamamoto, then.

04:24.700 --> 04:26.489
That's even more wrong!

04:26.490 --> 04:27.370
Yamakawa?

04:27.371 --> 04:28.909
It doesn't start with Yama!

04:28.910 --> 04:29.989
Kawada!

04:29.990 --> 04:32.870
If it didn't start with Yama, then it
certainly doesn't start with Kawa!

04:33.580 --> 04:34.959
Is there a Hashi in there?

04:34.960 --> 04:36.749
There isn't.

04:36.750 --> 04:38.170
Hmm...

04:41.010 --> 04:42.589
Miyamura.

04:42.590 --> 04:43.880
Miyamura?

04:44.510 --> 04:46.430
Just as I thought!

04:47.680 --> 04:48.929
You liar!

04:48.930 --> 04:50.850
Let's hurry to the science classroom, then.

04:54.020 --> 04:55.190
Miyamura!

04:56.190 --> 04:57.650
Pipe down, will ya?!

05:12.080 --> 05:15.540
Hori

05:16.500 --> 05:18.129
Onii-chan!

05:18.130 --> 05:19.629
I'm heading out!

05:19.630 --> 05:20.840
Take care.

05:24.090 --> 05:25.420
Pardon me.

05:26.590 --> 05:27.590
Hori-san?

05:28.640 --> 05:30.010
Let's do some homew-

05:41.230 --> 05:42.230
Good morning.

05:43.990 --> 05:46.070
We were going to do homework, weren't we?

05:52.490 --> 05:54.949
I'm sorry the A/C broke.

05:54.950 --> 05:56.660
The heat doesn't bother me.

05:58.080 --> 05:59.829
It's not like I wear anything when I sleep.

05:59.830 --> 06:00.830
What?

06:03.150 --> 06:04.919
But I do wear underwear.

06:04.920 --> 06:06.510
Is that so...

06:08.680 --> 06:10.680
I thought it was normal.

06:11.350 --> 06:13.850
Are all boys like that?

06:14.430 --> 06:17.890
Now that I think about it,
he does undress pretty easily.

06:21.310 --> 06:22.519
Miyamura.

06:22.520 --> 06:23.400
What's up?

06:23.401 --> 06:25.319
Show me your tattoos.

06:25.320 --> 06:27.149
Um, OK.

06:27.150 --> 06:28.650
Don't undress!

06:29.530 --> 06:32.579
It's scary to think that you'd immediately
undress when someone asks to see them!

06:32.580 --> 06:35.239
Do you <i>always</i> undress in front of everyone?

06:35.240 --> 06:36.409
No.

06:36.410 --> 06:37.749
And in front of Tooru?

06:37.750 --> 06:40.039
If he tells you to undress,
does your heart skip a beat?

06:40.040 --> 06:41.379
That depends...

06:41.380 --> 06:42.879
Then-

06:42.880 --> 06:45.250
Hori-san, I'll ask you directly.

06:46.050 --> 06:47.050
Why?

06:49.010 --> 06:52.009
You rarely get embarrassed,

06:52.010 --> 06:55.770
so I was just curious about which
situations would make you embarrassed.

06:56.430 --> 06:58.980
Because I'm always the one fussing!

06:59.890 --> 07:00.980
Right...

07:01.440 --> 07:02.649
He's talking formal...

07:02.650 --> 07:05.820
What? Should I have been embarrassed there?

07:08.740 --> 07:10.150
OK, let's start over!

07:10.450 --> 07:11.699
No need for that!

07:11.700 --> 07:12.819
But it's hot...

07:12.820 --> 07:14.450
So you <i>are</i> hot, after all!

07:16.330 --> 07:17.950
Say, Hori-san...

07:18.580 --> 07:23.290
So, you think I'd act nonchalantly
no matter the situation?

07:24.130 --> 07:25.290
A little...

07:28.130 --> 07:30.720
I ran into Shindo the other day.

07:30.930 --> 07:34.050
Even though she's your girlfriend,
you still don't call her by her first name?

07:35.010 --> 07:37.889
I'm telling you, she's not my girlfriend.

07:37.890 --> 07:39.429
Is she popular?

07:39.430 --> 07:41.229
She gets would-be
suitors from time to time.

07:41.230 --> 07:44.109
That's not cool! You
need to connect with her!

07:44.110 --> 07:46.319
Huh? But why?

07:46.320 --> 07:51.610
I'm worried that you'll get
dumped by your girlfriend.

07:53.320 --> 07:54.449
What's your real reason?

07:54.450 --> 07:56.619
Please introduce me to her friends.

07:56.620 --> 07:57.620
Fat chance.

08:00.710 --> 08:04.000
Even I get embarrassed
about calling you my girlfriend.

08:05.290 --> 08:06.669
It's from Shindo.

08:06.670 --> 08:07.670
Don't worry.

08:07.750 --> 08:11.300
Next time I'll tell him properly
that you're not my girlfriend.

08:12.010 --> 08:14.510
You don't really need to deny it.

08:15.470 --> 08:18.759
"I got a girlfriend! Isn't she cute?

08:18.760 --> 08:23.479
We were talking about going
somewhere next time. Just the four of us!

08:23.480 --> 08:25.980
Make sure to bring protection!"

08:28.480 --> 08:29.730
What is it?

08:30.780 --> 08:32.319
What is it? I'm curious!

08:32.320 --> 08:34.529
P-Please give it a rest!

08:34.530 --> 08:36.120
Stop speaking formally!

08:40.450 --> 08:42.039
Sup, man!

08:42.040 --> 08:43.040
Die!

08:44.870 --> 08:46.670
See you next time.

08:46.670 --> 08:47.880
Take care.

08:46.671 --> 08:52.340
Hori

08:55.890 --> 08:59.310
I still don't know anything about Miyamura.

09:10.940 --> 09:12.869
You shouldn't be up! You need to sleep!

09:12.870 --> 09:14.999
I'm going to school.

09:15.000 --> 09:20.159
I don't want to become an idiot. So I'm
not going to catch a cold in the summer.

09:20.160 --> 09:21.869
But don't you have one right now?

09:21.870 --> 09:23.410
Do not.

09:24.290 --> 09:25.330
Geez...

09:29.790 --> 09:30.790
Tissues...

09:32.510 --> 09:35.089
Hori-san, do you need a towel?

09:35.090 --> 09:36.050
I do.

09:36.051 --> 09:37.089
Some sports drink too?

09:37.090 --> 09:38.180
Yes, please.

09:38.470 --> 09:41.059
Wait, why are you here?

09:41.060 --> 09:43.389
I got a call from Souta.

09:43.390 --> 09:45.270
He said, "My big sis is dying."

09:46.810 --> 09:48.189
Is that so?

09:48.190 --> 09:49.860
I'll bring the sports drink.

09:52.900 --> 09:54.069
Wai-

09:54.070 --> 09:55.240
What are you-

09:55.950 --> 09:57.359
Where are you going?

09:57.360 --> 09:58.360
What?

09:58.690 --> 09:59.660
I'm going to brin-

09:59.661 --> 10:01.080
Where are you going?!

10:09.380 --> 10:12.000
Hori-san, you should get to bed.

10:14.260 --> 10:15.969
Where are you going?

10:15.970 --> 10:21.850
Why are you never, ever, ever around?!

10:24.810 --> 10:27.480
I'm sorry, Kyouko.

10:28.350 --> 10:30.980
Don't be. Have a safe trip.

10:40.570 --> 10:42.490
Where are you going?

10:43.740 --> 10:47.499
Hori-san, instead of asking,
"Where are you going?"

10:47.500 --> 10:49.580
shouldn't you be saying, "Don't go?"

10:52.960 --> 10:55.840
Sorry for acting like a know-it-all there.

11:00.050 --> 11:01.390
I'm not going anywhere.

11:02.470 --> 11:04.909
Hori-san, as long as you don't
say or think, "I don't need you!"

11:04.910 --> 11:07.219
Or, "I'm sick of seeing your face!"

11:07.220 --> 11:11.650
Or, "Just get lost!"

11:12.610 --> 11:14.060
I'll be here.

11:30.610 --> 11:33.749
I feel... sick...

11:33.750 --> 11:35.380
Hey, Hori-san?!

11:38.130 --> 11:42.090
I've already contacted
Ishikawa-kun at school...

11:43.470 --> 11:46.720
Looks like tomorrow's extra lessons
aren't mandatory for third-year students.

11:48.720 --> 11:50.390
And, um...

11:52.730 --> 11:56.980
I've liked you for quite some time.

11:58.190 --> 12:00.820
Other than that, there's
plenty of food in the fridge.

12:01.240 --> 12:04.370
Call me if anything
happens. I'll come right away.

12:13.960 --> 12:14.920
What?

12:14.921 --> 12:17.289
Why did you mix that
along with school notices?

12:17.290 --> 12:18.960
Something that important...

12:20.300 --> 12:26.010
I want to make sure, but I don't
want to make him say that again...

12:28.100 --> 12:30.680
Izumi-kun...

12:31.100 --> 12:34.600
Izumi-kun...

12:36.400 --> 12:38.070
Izum-

12:39.900 --> 12:41.190
It was just a dream.

12:42.190 --> 12:45.700
Dream, my ass! You called me!

12:47.410 --> 12:50.199
Wait, so she wasn't your girlfriend?

12:50.200 --> 12:51.949
Haven't I told you enough times?

12:51.950 --> 12:55.670
Why are you asking me?
What about Ishikawa-kun?

12:56.380 --> 12:58.340
I can't ask him...

13:00.300 --> 13:01.710
So that's how it is...

13:02.300 --> 13:04.009
How'd you confess?

13:04.010 --> 13:05.719
Something like, "I love you!"

13:05.720 --> 13:06.430
Not like that!

13:06.431 --> 13:07.680
Ow!

13:09.720 --> 13:13.560
I left without hearing her answer.

13:15.020 --> 13:16.479
I'm just a coward, right?

13:16.480 --> 13:20.650
Nah. You're so frank about it, it hurts.

13:21.610 --> 13:23.490
What do you want to do with her?

13:24.450 --> 13:26.700
Do you want to embrace her all day?

13:27.490 --> 13:29.829
Do you want to walk arm-in-arm?

13:29.830 --> 13:31.510
Do you want to brag to everyone about her?

13:31.950 --> 13:34.409
Do you want her to tell
you that she loves you?

13:34.410 --> 13:35.999
Do you want to cause her grief?

13:36.000 --> 13:38.079
Do you want her to stay with you?

13:38.080 --> 13:40.750
Do you never want anyone
to steal her away from you?

13:42.630 --> 13:44.209
Do you want to kiss her?

13:44.210 --> 13:45.339
Do you want to have sex with her?

13:45.340 --> 13:45.880
Huh?

13:45.881 --> 13:48.179
Well, it's a pretty important matter.

13:48.180 --> 13:50.640
Did you confess to her so
you could do all of those things?

13:51.560 --> 13:53.019
Not really.

13:53.020 --> 13:57.899
But I think the one about not wanting
her to be stolen away sounds about right.

13:57.900 --> 14:00.650
Well, that sounds reasonable.

14:02.690 --> 14:05.110
Can I tell you something that
might rub you the wrong way?

14:05.740 --> 14:09.870
If I were a girl, I wouldn't date me.

14:10.450 --> 14:15.660
A gloomy, plain weirdo who
was despised in junior high.

14:16.250 --> 14:18.499
He's a lousy scholar.

14:18.500 --> 14:20.210
Just someone below-average.

14:21.750 --> 14:24.299
In contrast, Hori-san is like the sun.

14:24.300 --> 14:26.760
There's always someone around her.

14:28.880 --> 14:32.350
She's intelligent, funny,
and popular in class.

14:32.930 --> 14:33.969
I can't hope to-

14:33.970 --> 14:37.809
Are <i>those</i> your true feelings toward her?

14:37.810 --> 14:39.020
That's bull!

14:39.310 --> 14:44.150
On top of being in denial about
yourself, you're denying Hori-san as well!

14:45.070 --> 14:49.359
Don't just utter something that'll only
serve to make the person you like sad!

14:49.360 --> 14:50.490
Don't run away!

14:52.530 --> 14:53.530
Yeah.

14:54.160 --> 14:56.039
Thank you, Koichi.

14:56.040 --> 14:56.870
Huh?

14:56.871 --> 14:58.749
You sure can count on a guy who's
<i>still</i> in their second-year.

14:58.750 --> 15:01.170
C'mon, don't say that!

15:05.420 --> 15:08.419
What? Hori-san's not coming today either?

15:08.420 --> 15:11.639
Yeah, she's a little under the weather.

15:11.640 --> 15:12.680
Is that so?

15:13.390 --> 15:16.140
But I doubt that's all...

15:18.480 --> 15:21.190
I'm her friend. I can just tell...

15:30.780 --> 15:31.949
All right!

15:31.950 --> 15:33.659
Chika, are you OK?

15:33.660 --> 15:35.990
Don't worry. I'm OK.

15:37.040 --> 15:38.079
Oh, it's Miyamura!

15:38.080 --> 15:39.080
Miyamura!

15:39.081 --> 15:40.959
Miyamura-kun?

15:40.960 --> 15:42.670
Ah, Miyamura-kun!

15:51.340 --> 15:53.090
What are you doing?!

15:59.100 --> 16:00.229
My bad.

16:00.230 --> 16:01.390
Shut up!

16:06.060 --> 16:08.900
It's gonna be bad news
if I keep missing school.

16:09.690 --> 16:11.030
I'm home!

16:13.280 --> 16:15.320
I just saw him earlier.

16:15.820 --> 16:16.869
Where?

16:16.870 --> 16:18.619
He was with a girl.

16:18.620 --> 16:19.699
Huh?

16:19.700 --> 16:22.249
They were <i>real</i> close, even locking arms!

16:22.250 --> 16:23.499
Who was it?

16:23.500 --> 16:24.670
Beats me.

16:34.050 --> 16:35.839
Eh? She came back?

16:35.840 --> 16:40.270
Yeah, but she's kind of avoiding you...

16:42.680 --> 16:44.270
Did you two fight or something?

16:50.780 --> 16:51.990
Hori-san?

16:53.530 --> 16:54.490
Um...

16:54.491 --> 16:56.570
I have to hurry home!

16:57.700 --> 16:58.869
See ya.

16:58.870 --> 16:59.950
Were you awake?

17:11.510 --> 17:12.709
At that time, I-

17:12.710 --> 17:13.720
Who was it?

17:15.300 --> 17:17.759
The person you were locking arms with?

17:17.760 --> 17:18.550
Who was it?

17:18.551 --> 17:20.719
Ah, you mean Chika-chan?

17:20.720 --> 17:22.389
Chika-chan?

17:22.390 --> 17:24.099
Yeah. She's from Yasaka.

17:24.100 --> 17:27.310
It's the first time I've heard
you call a girl by her first name.

17:27.600 --> 17:29.530
Do you go on walks with her?

17:30.020 --> 17:33.030
I-I'm not in <i>that</i> kind
of relationship with her!

17:33.490 --> 17:35.989
She's Shindo's girlfriend, honest!

17:35.990 --> 17:37.159
Chika-chan...

17:37.160 --> 17:39.450
Chika-chan twisted her
ankle because of Shindo.

17:39.830 --> 17:43.369
She had fallen off her bike, so I
just propped her up onto my shoulder.

17:43.370 --> 17:44.540
Otherwise, Chika-chan's just-

17:43.830 --> 17:43.908
Hori Kyouko

17:45.040 --> 17:46.580
What's that?!

17:47.500 --> 17:48.460
I'm telling you that Chik-

17:48.461 --> 17:51.710
"Chika!" "Chika!" "Chika!"
"Chika!" Shut up already!

17:55.220 --> 17:56.260
Scary...

17:56.720 --> 18:00.549
She's short-tempered, selfish, violent,

18:00.550 --> 18:03.679
and has no sense of self-control...

18:03.680 --> 18:04.850
You're a goner.

18:09.350 --> 18:11.860
Should I muster some
courage to confirm it...?

18:12.690 --> 18:15.110
It's gotten way past that point...

18:16.190 --> 18:16.700
But...

18:16.701 --> 18:19.200
Hori Kyouko

18:29.330 --> 18:31.590
Throwing those textbooks in his face...

18:32.590 --> 18:36.010
Is this really how it's going to end?

18:36.840 --> 18:39.219
Onee-chan! He's here!

18:39.220 --> 18:40.589
Tell him I'm not home.

18:40.590 --> 18:42.100
Pardon me.

18:46.180 --> 18:47.180
Here you go.

18:47.810 --> 18:49.440
Yeah, thanks.

18:50.810 --> 18:52.519
Definitely...

18:52.520 --> 18:53.940
upset.

19:00.910 --> 19:02.170
- Sorry!
- Sorry!

19:04.080 --> 19:06.909
To think I threw these at you...

19:06.910 --> 19:09.369
Ah, don't sweat it.

19:09.370 --> 19:11.499
It was my fault for bringing up Chik-

19:11.500 --> 19:15.420
I mean, Shindo's girlfriend.

19:16.840 --> 19:19.379
So about Chika-chan's last name...

19:19.380 --> 19:21.130
I don't know.

19:24.100 --> 19:25.640
So <i>that's</i> how it was.

19:46.490 --> 19:50.119
To tell you the truth, this
sofa is for one person.

19:50.120 --> 19:51.210
It's my father's.

19:52.040 --> 19:54.580
Though I haven't seen him for awhile.

19:59.210 --> 20:00.300
I was awake.

20:12.560 --> 20:13.810
Is that so?

20:15.060 --> 20:16.150
Miyamura...

20:24.990 --> 20:27.240
Kyouko, this boy...

20:28.580 --> 20:29.580
Who is he?

20:41.170 --> 20:45.969
