20:45.970 --> 20:50.589
when we took a detour

20:50.590 --> 20:54.639
on the way home, just the two of us

20:54.640 --> 21:02.359
as we silently squinted at the sunlight.

20:54.640 --> 20:56.205
Timers Mamo-chan

20:54.640 --> 20:56.205
